      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUMMER FORCE (7) massive performance at her second race start from the outside draw with a commanding victory over 1300m at this track. Can race much closer today and has the upside to go on with it now. FORCE MARCH (1) lightly raced gelding who demolished a decent Maiden field with a comprehensive win as fav over 1280m at Muswellbrook. Should be even stronger heading into this and carries the big weights well. Go close. EXPIDO (2) is racing well on the provincial circuit and gets every chance today from the low draw. Kept coming with the 58kg to secure third over 1200m at Gosford in BM64 grade. That form is good enough to take this out. THE WARRIOR (4) returns from a 32-day let-up. Strong through the line with a tidy third in a Cl1 at Tuncurry.  Each way player.",
